Fucking hell.  10 years of playing, or very nearly.  And I finally did it.

Fraid I didn't take notes as I was playing, but the wand of wishing
randomly found in Sokoban was probably what made the difference.  I've
been close for a while.

You offer the Amulet of Yendor to Odin...--More-- 
An invisible choir sings, and you are bathed in radiance...--More- 
The voice of Odin booms out: "Congratulations, mortal!"--More-- 
"In return for thy service, I grant thee the gift of Immortality!"--More-- 
You ascend to the status of Demigoddess...--More-- 

I know I don't hang out here much, but I just had to tell you guys how
pleased I am!

